{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE FAST, EARN CASH, BRAKE NEVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cabbie\u2019s arch enemy Diesel is holding Amber captive, only you can save her! Cab-venture alone or with friends and master the art of top-down driving whilst taxiing, racing and delivering, to earn as much cash as possible to fund your rescue mission. Speed is rewarded with tips, brakes are there for emergencies only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/f894f7c6e12c4dfa4ffbce26dd30e725.poster.avif?t=1766070455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/f894f7c6e12c4dfa4ffbce26dd30e725.webm?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/f894f7c6e12c4dfa4ffbce26dd30e725.mp4?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE OUT IN A FRIENDLY GAME OF TAXI-TAG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a \u2018tag\u2019 style game mode in every unlocked map. Scramble to pick up and drop off Meeplets one at a time, the first to five wins, but if you crash in any way you lose the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash into your friends to sabotage them, we encourage it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/3501b790db8181568822bfd305a79d90.poster.avif?t=1766070455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/3501b790db8181568822bfd305a79d90.webm?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/3501b790db8181568822bfd305a79d90.mp4?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOST, DRIFT, DODGE, JUMP, DONUT, REPEAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your environment with speed, but also style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/5d0ff8362ceed40c449f461ff3a9310b.poster.avif?t=1766070455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/5d0ff8362ceed40c449f461ff3a9310b.webm?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/5d0ff8362ceed40c449f461ff3a9310b.mp4?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE MIND CONTROLLED SHEEPLETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diesel is deploying poor Sheeplets controlled by mind control helmets making them destroy the town to hinder your rescue mission, zap the helmets, save the sheep, they\u2019ll love you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e8e1128f3e3965876731dcb26c857f33.poster.avif?t=1766070455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e8e1128f3e3965876731dcb26c857f33.webm?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e8e1128f3e3965876731dcb26c857f33.mp4?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT AND CUSTOMISE CAR-ACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as Cabbie and co; Nova, Journey and Clutch. As you reach new worlds you\u2019ll meet new friends to join the party. You\u2019ll also collect loads of new and shiny cosmetics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/446a8d2f44df8bb2aa360d43b73c4b8e.poster.avif?t=1766070455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/446a8d2f44df8bb2aa360d43b73c4b8e.webm?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/446a8d2f44df8bb2aa360d43b73c4b8e.mp4?t=1766070455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your way - Classic, Hybrid, Automatic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute electric car-acters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable meeplets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheeplets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickups</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2540530?t=1766070455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766070455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/3b5bf471c45bbc032f6b7